  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev900.html",
  "prefLabel": "Rev 902.09 Mixed-Share Organizations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 902.09 Mixed-Share Organizations. With respect to organizations composed of a mixture of share types, the tax status of such organizations and the holders of equity interests in such organizations, shall be determined as follows:\n\n(a) When the majority of the outstanding equity interest in the organization is composed of transferable shares:\n\n(1) Each share shall be deemed a transferable share;\n\n(2) The organization shall not be subject to tax under RSA 77; and\n\n(3) The distributions of profits to any equity interest holder shall be considered a dividend subject to the interest and dividends tax; or\n\n(b) When the majority of the outstanding equity interest in the organization is composed of non-transferable shares:\n\n(1) Each share shall be deemed a non-transferable share;\n\n(2) The organization shall be subject to tax under RSA 77; and\n\n(3) The distribution of profits to any equity interest holder shall not be considered a dividend subject to the interest and dividends tax.\n\nSource. #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04); ss by #9658, eff 2-24-10; ss by #9843, eff 12-23-10 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 900); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev900.html"
}
